{
    "title": "Seattle Seahawks Mobile",
    "description": "This is the official Seattle Seahawks Mobile App. Use your iPhone or iPad to stay connected with the team all year long. Team news, mobile tickets, in-stadium features, real-time statistics, video highlights, and more are available just a few taps away. Features include:\u2028\r\nNews, Videos and Photos: The latest headlines and views of everything the team does from gameday at Lumen Field to practice at the Virginia Mason Athletic Center. Watch highlights from every game on your device.\r\n\r\nMobile Ticketing: Use your Seahawks app to view, transfer and sell your Seahawks tickets.\u2028\r\nCustomized Gameday Experience: Customize your app by creating a profile. If you\u2019re attending the game, link your mobile tickets and take advantage of mobile concession ordering, Season Ticket Holder discount cards and more. If you\u2019re watching at home, you can create a profile to have the latest highlights and stats right at your fingertips.\r\n\r\nSchedule: View upcoming games, scores and stats of previous games from the season, and purchase tickets for upcoming games.\r\n\r\nRoster & Depth Chart: Get to know the team by a full team roster and depth chart.\r\n\r\nStats & Standings: Real-time scoring updates from the official NFL stats engine, head-to-head stats, player stats, drive-by-drive stats, box scores, and out-of-town scores around the league. Division and conference standings offered throughout the season.\r\n\r\nShop the Pro Shop: Shop the latest Seahawks merchandise sold directly by the Seahawks Pro Shop.\r\n\r\nPlease note: This app features Nielsen's proprietary measurement software which contributes to market research, like Nielsen's TV Ratings. Please see https://priv-policy.imrworldwide.com/priv/mobile/us/en/optout.html for more information.",
    "descriptionHTML": "This is the official Seattle Seahawks Mobile App. Use your iPhone or iPad to stay connected with the team all year long. Team news, mobile tickets, in-stadium features, real-time statistics, video highlights, and more are available just a few taps away. Features include:\u2028<br>News, Videos and Photos: The latest headlines and views of everything the team does from gameday at Lumen Field to practice at the Virginia Mason Athletic Center. Watch highlights from every game on your device.<br><br>Mobile Ticketing: Use your Seahawks app to view, transfer and sell your Seahawks tickets.\u2028<br>Customized Gameday Experience: Customize your app by creating a profile. If you\u2019re attending the game, link your mobile tickets and take advantage of mobile concession ordering, Season Ticket Holder discount cards and more. If you\u2019re watching at home, you can create a profile to have the latest highlights and stats right at your fingertips.<br><br>Schedule: View upcoming games, scores and stats of previous games from the season, and purchase tickets for upcoming games.<br><br>Roster &amp; Depth Chart: Get to know the team by a full team roster and depth chart.<br><br>Stats &amp; Standings: Real-time scoring updates from the official NFL stats engine, head-to-head stats, player stats, drive-by-drive stats, box scores, and out-of-town scores around the league. Division and conference standings offered throughout the season.<br><br>Shop the Pro Shop: Shop the latest Seahawks merchandise sold directly by the Seahawks Pro Shop.<br><br>Please note: This app features Nielsen&#39;s proprietary measurement software which contributes to market research, like Nielsen&#39;s TV Ratings. Please see https://priv-policy.imrworldwide.com/priv/mobile/us/en/optout.html for more information.",
